    "title": "ETA - What's the move?",
    "description": "ETA is your ultimate guide to discovering the best events, cocktail bars, and lounges in your city. Our platform handpicks the most exciting experiences, from lively turn-ups and chic brunches to captivating art shows and more. Stay in the know and never miss out on what's happening around you.\r\n\r\nBut that\u2019s not all\u2014ETA also brings the community together. Use our chat feature to discuss upcoming events with friends, or connect with new people in your city through our general chat. With ETA, you\u2019re always in the loop and connected to the culture.\r\n\r\nDownload ETA and elevate your social life today!",
